<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" xmlns:its="http://www.w3.org/2005/11/its" type="topic" id="usage" xml:lang="nb_NO">
	<section id="adding-files">
		<info>
			<link type="guide" xref="index#usage"/>
		</info>
		<title>Tillegg av filer</title>
		<p>Klikk <gui style="button">Legg til filer</gui>-knappen med de filene du vil rense. En filvelger vil åpnes, og du kan velge filene du ønsker å rense.</p>
		<figure>
			<title><gui style="button">Legg til filer</gui>-knappen</title>
			<media type="image" src="figures/add-files-button.png" its:translate="no"/>
		</figure>
		<p>To add whole folders at once, press the <gui style="button">Add Folders</gui> button. A file chooser will open, select the folders you want to add. You can optionally choose to also add all files from all subfolders by checking the <gui style="checkbox">Add files from subfolders</gui> checkbox.</p>
		<figure>
			<title><gui style="button">Add Folders</gui> button</title>
			<media type="image" src="figures/add-folders-button.png" its:translate="no"/>
		</figure>
	</section>
	<section id="viewing-metadata">
		<info>
			<link type="guide" xref="index#usage"/>
		</info>
		<title>Visning av metadata</title>
		<p>Click on a file in the list to open the detailed view. If it has metadata, it will be shown there.</p>
		<figure>
			<title>Detaljert visning av metadataen</title>
			<media type="image" src="figures/metadata-example.png" its:translate="no"/>
		</figure>
	</section>
	<section id="cleaning-files">
		<info>
			<link type="guide" xref="index#usage"/>
		</info>
		<title>Rensing av filer</title>
		<p>For å rense filene i vinduet, trykker du på <gui style="button">Rens</gui>-knappen. Det kan ta litt tid å fullføre renseprosessen.</p>
		<figure>
			<title><gui style="button">Rens</gui>-knappen</title>
			<media type="image" src="figures/clean-button.png" its:translate="no"/>
		</figure>
	</section>
	<section id="lightweight-cleaning">
		<info>
			<link type="guide" xref="index#usage"/>
		</info>
		<title>Lett rensing</title>
		<p>By default, the removal process might alter a bit the data of your files, in order to remove as much metadata as possible. For example, texts in PDF might not be selectable anymore, compressed images might get compressed again…</p>
		<p>Lettvektsmodus, som ikke er like grundig, og ikke gjør noen destruktive endringer i noen av filene dine.</p>
	</section>
</page>
